      "image": "assets/images/258755/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place milk, vanilla extract, and butter in a saucepan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/I2AXLyUgnXq78yCO-cOFsJtXo2c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-258755-Simple-custard-Step-2-0cba9e584139411c9675f0c9b634c792.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258755/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook and stir over medium heat until simmering; remove from heat before it comes to a boil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/99sHnkFeLHNFoWoBkgs2E5Z5pNM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-258755-Simple-custard-Step-3-ab56fedec95d43f4b37fb659deb8d3f0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258755/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk eggs, sugar, and cornstarch together in a bowl until sugar dissolves.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5IB3J-uh3Cg0-RhNpavAMZ_joOY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-258755-Simple-custard-Step-4-f72bba1809b244cbba954ee462c487b5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258755/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Set the saucepan back over low heat. Pour in egg mixture slowly, whisking constantly, until custard thickens enough to coat the bottom of a spoon, 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Z-9KTRnLaACXR_IRKcUtLvp1ezE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-258755-Simple-custard-Step-5-9269c6b38e2e440e94c33e56f6ca6ec5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258755/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve warm or transfer custard into a large bowl and cover.",
